{title: Samne Ye Kaun Aaya}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Samne yeh [A]kaun aaya,        [E]dil mein hui hulchul?
[E]Dekh ke bas [A]ek hi jhalak,        [E]ho gaye [B]hum paa [E]gal!
[E]Samne yeh [A]kaun aaya,        [E]dil mein hui hulchul?
[E]Dekh ke bas [A]ek hi jhalak,        [E]ho gaye [B]hum paa [E]gal!
Aray, [B]baatein, mula [A]kaatein,        Hum [E]se bhi to hongi;
Aray, [B]hum [A]se, ghu [A]len [E]ge,        Woh [E]aaj nahin to [E]kal!
[E]Samne yeh [A]kaun aaya,        [E]dil mein hui hulchul?
[E]Dekh ke bas [A]ek hi jhalak,        [E]ho gaye [B]hum paa [E]gal!
[E]La la la [A]la... [E]La la la la...        [A]La la la [A]la... [E]Lal lal la...
[E]La la la [A]la... [E]La la la la...        [E]La la la [A]la... [E]Lal lal la...
[E]Rehna hai [E]yahaan to,        [E]dono hain [E]jawaan to,
[E]Bhalaa duur kaise ra [A]henge,        [A]Maana woh ha [B]seen [A]hai,
to [A]hum bhi kum na [B]heen [A]hain -,        Woh [A]maghroor [E]kaise rahenge?
